    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d703">

                <pb facs="0667" n="655" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg655"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890G.6363/408: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Iraq</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Baghdad</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-05-07T15:00:00+03:00">May 7, 1943—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 7—1:46 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>197. Legation’s telegram No. 140, April 7 [<hi rendition="#italic">2</hi>], 3
                    p.m. Necessary legislation has been passed by Parliament and Royal decree issued
                    ratifying IPC and Iraqi Government’s oil agreement as of May 1.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
